I wake up.
It is very early in the morning.
My flat is still completely dark.
I look toward the window.
The sky outside is black.
I hear the wind.
It is very windy.
My mobile phone is lying next to the bed.
I pick up the mobile phone.
I open the weather app.
The app shows bad weather.
It will rain today.
And it will be very cold.
The weather is uninviting.
I sigh.
My bed is nice and warm.
I stay in bed for five more minutes.
